    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 3.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ne synd ealle cyricean na gelicre mæðe woruldlice wurðscipes wyrðe, þeah hig godcundlice habban hal[g]unge gelice.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Not all churches are to be regarded as possessing the same status in civil law, though from the side of religion they all possess the same sanctity.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ne synd ealle cyricean na gelicre mæðe woruldlice wurðscipes wyrðe, þeah hig godcundlice habban halsunge gelice.</ab>
      </div>
